<title>USA: Longmeadow, Mass., won by Fidelity Capital.</title>
<headline>Longmeadow, Mass., won by Fidelity Capital.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fidelity Capital Markets, Inc., said it won $1.360 million of Longmeadow, Mass., general obligation limited tax bonds, with a true interest cost of 4.93 percent.</p>
